      "statusChangeID": "5c7dc29235bbaf5a964c79c2",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "in progress",
      "value": "This is kind of a two-parter: We're aware of a bug with the New row that means that the results you get back from the server don't make much sense. We're aware of this bug and are looking into it.\n\nThe second part is that we're aware that finding worlds and sorting them in ways you want isn't easily possible right now. This would require a revamp of the way that you search for/view worlds, which means a UI refresh. Its something we want to do, but will take a bit for us to get to.\n\nI'm marking this in-progress specifically due to us actively taking a look at the New Worlds row issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
