      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Same here, as I created the world ID back in August 2018 (to test the scale with friends back then), my world is not appearing in the new tab and instantly got buried in the Recently updated instead even though it was only made public Yesterday.\n\nI feel like this issue will only be aggravated by the Community Labs system which means a world that stays too long in there could not get any visibility in New once it does get released.\n\nWhy not use the Published stat instead of the created stat?",
      "viewerReactions": null
